{"id":"scene.refine","version":1,"description":"基于已有采集、摘要和修改要求生成新版本；绑定完整SceneProgram与保存的场景计划，保留用户硬要求、修订历史和旧证据。","inputs":{"parent_task_id":"string","name":"string","description":"string","scene_program_path":"完整SceneProgram路径；真实场景策略启用时必填，并引用包含标题、摘要和修订记录的保存计划","service_config":"path"},"outputs":{"scene":"SceneProgram","capture":"CaptureEvidence"},"steps":[{"id":"refine","uses":"spatialforge.refine","arguments":{"parent_task_id":"$inputs.parent_task_id","name":"$inputs.name","description":"$inputs.description","scene_program_path":"$inputs.scene_program_path"}},{"id":"refine_ready","uses":"spatialforge.observe","arguments":{"run_id":"$refine.run_id"},"await_terminal":true}]}
